# Runtime-required data (historical match CSVs + player stats — total ~3.4 MB).
# The free-tier feature engineer needs KnowledgeFilesCSV/ at startup, otherwise
# every fixture returns identical probabilities (all features resolve to 0.0).
# RAG player-name patterns need fact_player_stats.csv. Keep these in the image.
# (The `~100MB+` comment in an earlier revision was a mis-estimate — actual size
# is 3.4 MB, small enough that there's no benefit to excluding them.)

